  </p>

  <h2 id="gates">Pass The 3 Gates before you quit a job to freelance full-time</h2>

  <p>
    The 4-Checkpoint Protocol tells you whether freelancing fits on paper. The 3 Gates make you test it in
    the real world before you give up a stable income for it.
  </p>

  <div class="gates-block">
    <p class="gates-block__title">
      Do not resign from a job or turn down a stable offer before passing all three gates.
    </p>
    <div class="gates-row">
      <div class="gate">
        <span class="gate__num">Gate 1</span>
        <span class="gate__name">Proof of skill</span>
        <p>
          Run at least one real campaign or project outside of practice exercises, and track the actual
          before-and-after result, even if the budget or account was small.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="gate">
        <span class="gate__num">Gate 2</span>
        <span class="gate__name">Proof of communication</span>
        <p>
          Explain, in under two minutes, what you did and what result it produced, in language a
          non-marketing business owner would understand and trust.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="gate">
        <span class="gate__num">Gate 3</span>
        <span class="gate__name">Proof of value</span>
        <p>
          Land at least one paying client, even a small one, and get a specific, written testimonial with a
          real number in it before you treat freelancing as your main income.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

